org:Organization – an organized group of people sharing a common purpose.
   Nel nostro dominio: la classe generale di ogni organizzazione.
org:FormalOrganization – an organization recognized in the world at large, in particular in legal
   jurisdictions, with its own rights and responsibilities (ha personalità giuridica).
   Nel nostro dominio: università, CNR, fondazioni, aziende.
org:OrganizationalUnit – a part of a larger formal organization, recognized only within it and
   with no legal personality of its own.
   Nel nostro dominio: scuole/facoltà, dipartimenti universitari, dipartimenti e istituti CNR,
   gruppi di ricerca, laboratori.

Proprietà
org:hasUnit (inversa org:unitOf) – un'organizzazione contiene un'unità (es. UniBo hasUnit DISI).
org:hasSubOrganization (inversa org:subOrganizationOf) – contenimento generale tra organizzazioni;
   org:hasUnit ⊑ org:hasSubOrganization.
org:transitiveSubOrganizationOf – chiusura transitiva di org:subOrganizationOf
   (es. gruppo → istituto → dipartimento CNR → CNR).
org:classification – classificazione dell'organizzazione con un concetto SKOS; per il tipo usiamo
   la sottoproprietà ac:hasOrganizationType (es. university, department, researchGroup, laboratory).</y:NodeLabel>
        </y:UMLNoteNode>
      </data>
    </node>
    <node id="n22">
      <data key="d6">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry height="44.0" width="106.8" x="-302.85558311000636" y="-24.472610848012522"/>
          <y:Fill color="#FFFF00" transparent="false"/>
          <y:BorderStyle color="#000000" type="line" width="1.0"/>
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="16" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" height="25.792043685913086" horizontalTextPosition="center" iconTextGap="4" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#000000" verticalTextPosition="bottom" visible="true" width="67.20014953613281" x="19.79992523193357" xml:space="preserve" y="9.103978157043457">org:Role</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="roundrectangle"/>
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
    <node id="n23">
      <data key="d6">
        <y:UMLNoteNode>
          <y:Geometry height="470.0" width="703.078003992016" x="-2045.9187265641617" y="-542.0"/>
          <y:Fill color="#CCFFFF" transparent="false"/>
          <y:BorderStyle color="#000000" type="line" width="1.0"/>
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="left" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="14" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" height="461.6300048828125" horizontalTextPosition="center" iconTextGap="4" modelName="internal" modelPosition="l" textColor="#000000" verticalTextPosition="bottom" visible="true" width="654.87158203125" x="4.0" xml:space="preserve" y="4.18499755859375">Position = continuous service at an institution with a position type (W3C ORG org:Membership)
 ac:atInstitution ⊑ org:organization – the institution (legal entity: università, CNR, azienda)
 ac:hasPositionType ⊑ org:role – qualifica (one vocabulary per sector: universities, EPR)
 ac:hasEmploymentType – tipo di rapporto: permanent, fixed-term, non-employment (e.g. assegno)
NEW Position when the institution, the position type or the employment type changes,
 or when the service is interrupted (e.g. RTDb -&gt; associato; move to another university;
 stabilisation of a fixed-term researcher at the same level)
Within a Position, each with its own dates:
 ac:hasHomeUnitMembership – afferenza / appartenenza (units of the institution only)
 ac:hasSecondment – assegnazione temporanea, distacco, comando (also at other institutions)
 ac:hasRegimePeriod -&gt; ac:hasRegime: full-time, definite-time, part-time
 ac:atSite – site of a unit membership (e.g. Cesena, Catania)
Offices without employment (vicedirettore CINI, socio GRIN, direttore di istituto CNR):
 plain org:Membership with org:role (vocab. to be defined).
ac:hasDisciplinaryCategory: subproperties and discipline subclasses at the top.
ac:hasUnitMembership (TTL only): superproperty of hasHomeUnitMembership
  and hasSecondment.
ac:CoAuthorshipRelation: one per pair of scholars (ac:concerns, exactly 2),
  with their common publication records and their number.
Periods: ac:TimeBoundedEntity ⊒ Position, UnitMembership, RegimePeriod (offices: via domain)
 ac:startDate / ac:endDate – precision given by the datatype: xsd:gYear "2015", xsd:gYearMonth
   "2021-03", xsd:date "2021-03-01" (range not declared in OWL; checked in SHACL)
 no ac:startDate = start unknown; ac:isOngoing true = in progress (as of the data);
 ac:isOngoing false without ac:endDate = ended, end unknown.</y:NodeLabel>
        </y:UMLNoteNode>
      </data>
    </node>
